# Long connected route (item 6 of the 2026-10-14 Legion review): 2 movers walk a serpentine of 30 lanes
# (each 600 cells long and 14 high, 2-cell baffles, 14-cell gaps at alternating ends) to the far end of the
# last lane, about 17,500 cells of route: a field potential of 87,356 at the head. Legion's 16-bit
# potentials saturated at 65535, so the field never reached the bodies: both stood trapped from the first
# ticks (work.trapped.total 2, stopped_permille 1000) and their orders retired after the 9000-tick grace,
# 459-468 cells from the click. With 32-bit potentials they walk the whole route and arrive (g.A.done
# 167,852-168,167 over the gate offsets). Retail's orders complete 408 cells short of the click. The
# control, serplong-control.scn, is the same shape with 16 lanes (potential 46,560), inside the old range:
# its hashes did not change with the widening.
